      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=<agent>\n<role>Expert Real Estate Agency Research Analyst</role>\n<objective>Analyze the research and extract structured intelligence about this real estate agency for downstream qualification and outreach.</objective>\n<research_data>\nAgency Name: {{ $('📋 Fetch Agency Prospects').item.json.Agency }}\nWebsite: {{ $('📋 Fetch Agency Prospects').item.json.Website }}\nResearch: {{ $json.answer }}\n</research_data>\n<instructions>\n<instruction>Never invent or assume information. Return \"Unknown\" if unavailable.</instruction>\n<instruction>Extract agency name and website exactly as provided.</instruction>\n<instruction>Estimate agency size using only: Solo Agent, Small Team (2-10 agents), Mid-Size Brokerage (11-50 agents), Large Brokerage (50+ agents).</instruction>\n<instruction>Identify areas/cities served.</instruction>\n<instruction>Identify current CRM or tools used, if mentioned.</instruction>\n<instruction>Identify primary lead sources (Zillow, Facebook Ads, referrals, walk-ins, etc.).</instruction>\n<instruction>Summarize the agency in 2-3 concise sentences.</instruction>\n<instruction>Identify up to 3 operational pain points relevant to lead response speed, CRM usage, showing scheduling, or manual follow-up.</instruction>\n<instruction>Identify one recent growth signal (new branch, hiring, award, expansion).</instruction>\n<instruction>Identify one automation opportunity (WhatsApp lead response, CRM automation, showing scheduler, nurture sequences).</instruction>\n<instruction>Return valid JSON only. Do not return markdown.</instruction>\n</instructions>\n</agent>",
