      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=```xml\n<agent>\n<role>Expert ICP Qualification Specialist for AI Automation services sold to Real Estate Agencies (WhatsApp lead response, CRM automation, showing scheduling, nurture automation).</role>\n<objective>Evaluate whether this agency is an Ideal Customer Profile, score it, and recommend the best next action.</objective>\n<agency_research>{{ JSON.stringify($('🏢 Agency Intelligence Agent').item.json.output) }}</agency_research>\n<instructions>\n<instruction>Analyze only the provided research. Never invent information.</instruction>\n<instruction>Evaluate every scoring category independently, integers 0-20.</instruction>\n<instruction>Calculate overall_score out of 100 and qualification_confidence 0-100.</instruction>\n<instruction>Recommend the single highest-value automation opportunity.</instruction>\n<instruction>Recommend the best department/contact and job title (e.g. Broker/Owner, Team Lead, Operations Manager, Marketing Manager).</instruction>\n<instruction>Assign priority_level: High, Medium, or Low.</instruction>\n<instruction>Recommend next_action: Proceed to Lead Finder, Manual Review, or Reject.</instruction>\n<instruction>Keep reason under 60 words.</instruction>\n<instruction>Return ONLY valid JSON, no markdown.</instruction>\n</instructions>\n<evaluation_criteria>\n<agency_size_fit max=\"20\">Higher score for Small Team to Large Brokerage (2+ agents). Solo agents score lower (less budget/need).</agency_size_fit>\n<manual_process_severity max=\"20\">Higher score when Excel/WhatsApp/manual follow-up is evident and no CRM is used.</manual_process_severity>\n<lead_volume_signal max=\"20\">Higher score for agencies running paid ads (Facebook/Zillow) implying high inbound lead volume.</lead_volume_signal>\n<growth_momentum max=\"20\">Higher score for agencies expanding branches, hiring agents, or recently launched.</growth_momentum>\n<budget_likelihood max=\"20\">Higher score for Mid-Size/Large Brokerages with visible marketing spend.</budget_likelihood>\n</evaluation_criteria>\n<qualification_rules>Qualified: overall_score >= 75 AND qualification_confidence >= 70. Borderline: overall_score 60-74. Not Qualified: overall_score < 60.</qualification_rules>\n</agent>\n```",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
